 "remarks": "Quiet street, for riding bikes and play. Spacious & open, this home has an open floor plan & the benefit of floor to ceiling windows for enjoyment of all seasons. Centered in the home is a FP & surrounded by the updated kitchen with handsome cabinetry, a large center island framed with beams, counter eating. SS appliances with wall over, micro, DW & refrigerator. There is also a sunroom off the LR, which can be used for play space or relaxing. It features 3 BRS, 2 updtd Bths on main level. Primary BR has its own Bth. Lower level has large family room space with FP, projection screen, 1/2 bth & office/BR. Laundry is also located there. Landlord has service contract with Standard oil, tenant must purchase oil from them. Credit report through Rent Spree, last 3 paystubs, past landlord & references. Tenant must carry renter w/liabliity coverage. Tenant pays for all utilities, snow removal & lawn care. Excellent credit a must. Deck is bein painted, do not walk on it until dry.",
